Only a small update this week.  I'm trying to leave things relatively
stable for awhile so that players aren't disrupted too much; this
includes save compatibility.  Again, at this point I don't expect to
need to break save compat for several weeks, minimum, especially now
that it's a bit more stable.

We were up to 12 simultaneous players on the server the past week and
were generally averaging 9 or so, which is certainly a landmark for
Spork; while I'm not so foolish as to think nethack.alt.org's being 
down didn't have a great deal to do with it and some of our traffic
being the "any port in a storm" type, it's still good to see people 
giving it a whirl.  Thanks, guys.

Changelog for last week below, such as it is:

